{% comment %} Shipping Policy {% endcomment %}
<div class="policy-page">
  <h1>Shipping &amp; Delivery Policy</h1>
  <p class="policy-date">Last updated: {{ 'now' | date: '%B %d, %Y' }}</p>

  <h2>Delivery Areas</h2>
  <p>We currently deliver to select residential communities in our service area. During checkout, please confirm your address is within our delivery zone.</p>

  <h2>Delivery Schedule</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Orders placed <strong>before midnight</strong> are delivered the next morning</li>
    <li>Deliveries are made between <strong>6 AM – 11 AM</strong></li>
    <li>We deliver 7 days a week</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Delivery Charges</h2>
  <p>Delivery is <strong>free</strong> on all orders. No hidden charges.</p>

  <h2>Delivery Confirmation</h2>
  <p>You will receive an SMS confirmation once your order is dispatched. Our delivery partner will contact you if they are unable to locate the address.</p>

  <h2>Failed Deliveries</h2>
  <p>If delivery is unsuccessful due to an incorrect address or unavailability, we will attempt to contact you. If unreachable, the order may be cancelled and refunded.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>For delivery queries, contact us at <a href="mailto:hello@thegoodpapaya.com">hello@thegoodpapaya.com</a>.</p>
</div>
